### Rate Limiting

#### [MODIFY] [rate-limit.service.ts](file:///c:/StudyMaterialDoNotTouch/tek/projects/libre/backend/auth/src/lib/rate-limit.service.ts)
* Add environment fallback variable `MAX_LOGIN_ATTEMPTS` (defaults to `5` if `process.env.MAX_LOGIN_ATTEMPTS` is undefined).
* Add methods:
  * `checkLoginLimit(email: string)`: Checks if the user is currently locked.
  * `handleFailedLogin(email: string)`: Increments login attempts in Redis and locks the email if it exceeds `MAX_LOGIN_ATTEMPTS`.
  * `handleSuccessfulLogin(email: string)`: Clears the login attempts and any active lock in Redis.

#### [MODIFY] [rate-limit.middleware.ts](file:///c:/StudyMaterialDoNotTouch/tek/projects/libre/backend/auth/src/middlewares/rate-limit.middleware.ts)
* Define and export `signinRateLimitMiddleware`:
  * Checks if the email is locked using `RateLimitService.checkLoginLimit(email)` before allowing the request to proceed.

