### Controllers

#### [MODIFY] [auth.controller.ts](file:///c:/StudyMaterialDoNotTouch/tek/projects/libre/backend/auth/src/controllers/auth.controller.ts)
* Define and export `signin` controller function:
  * Extract `email`, `password`, `clientId` from `req.body`.
  * Call `signinService`.
  * On success, return `200 OK` with JSON matching the sign-up verify format:
    ```json
    {
      "success": true,
      "message": "Signin successful",
      "data": {
        "accessToken": "...",
        "refreshToken": "..."
      }
    }
    ```
  * On error, pass to Express error middleware (`next(error)`).

